WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.940 --> 00:00:11.470
What’s up son? This week we gettin’ smashed with Ethan Frome

00:00:11.470 --> 00:00:12.710
by Edith Wharton.

00:00:16.460 --> 00:00:20.720
It’s hella burr up in Starkfield,
Massachusetts, where our outta-town narrator

00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:25.290
settin up shop. He starts hittin up all the
locals to get the low-down on some broke-ass

00:00:25.290 --> 00:00:31.470
cripple named Ethan Frome- who twenty years
ago had what errybody callin a “smash-up.”

00:00:31.470 --> 00:00:36.219
One day while the narrator cruisin
in Ethan’s hoopty, a gnarly snowstorm busts

00:00:36.219 --> 00:00:41.219
in to town. So they gotta roll over to Ethan’s
crib to hold it down til it passes.

00:00:41.219 --> 00:00:47.190
When- BAM! FLASHBACK SUCKA! 24 years ago Ethan was creepin around a church waitin to holler

00:00:47.190 --> 00:00:52.390
at Mattie, his wife Zeena’s COUSIN. See,
Zeena say her health so jacked up that they

00:00:52.390 --> 00:00:56.370
gotta have Mattie live with em as the help.
Since Zeena and Ethan don’t even

00:00:56.370 --> 00:01:02.199
talk no mo, Ethan jonesin to get a crack at
fine lil’ Mattie. Zeena ain’t no fool

00:01:02.199 --> 00:01:06.229
though, she know where Ethan’s mind at.
Ethan ALL fired up when Zeena rolls

00:01:06.229 --> 00:01:11.880
outta town to see the doc, cuz now he got
Mattie to himself. The first night, though,

00:01:11.880 --> 00:01:15.090
Ethan starts trippin and don’t say nuthin
bout his feelings.

00:01:15.090 --> 00:01:19.390
When Zeena back in the hood, she
say Mattie just ain’t cuttin it and they

00:01:19.390 --> 00:01:23.250
gotz to find a new girl.
Ethan thinks bout baggin Mattie and skippin

00:01:23.250 --> 00:01:27.910
town, but his pockets ain’t
fat enough to make it happen. Plus he wouldn’t

00:01:27.910 --> 00:01:30.820
be able to shake the guilt of abandoning his
woman.

00:01:30.820 --> 00:01:35.390
On the way to the train station,
Mattie and Ethan decide to get their sled

00:01:35.390 --> 00:01:40.220
on. Mattie say “You know what? A life without
you ain’t sh**. We should just ram in to

00:01:40.220 --> 00:01:44.230
that tree REAL FAST and spend our last seconds
together. Naw mean?”

00:01:44.230 --> 00:01:49.520
Ethan all like: “Ehhhhhh. Well.
Aigh’t. fu** it.” But nothin ever works

00:01:49.520 --> 00:01:54.720
for Ethan. Thoughts of Zeena enter his dome
makin him bone his one chance at escape. So

00:01:54.720 --> 00:01:58.640
instead of ending it, he paralyzes Mattie
and wrecks himself too.

00:02:01.160 --> 00:02:03.920
Back in the present, Ethan and the
narrator roll in to Ethan’s crib where now

00:02:03.920 --> 00:02:08.840
all three of them are crippled in their own
way. The only thing they got to look forward

00:02:08.840 --> 00:02:14.460
to is years of mean muggin eachother 24/7. Damn.

00:02:18.240 --> 00:02:20.620
Now this has got to be one of the most depressing

00:02:20.620 --> 00:02:24.490
books this G ever
read. Matter of fact, some gangstas say that

00:02:24.490 --> 00:02:28.700
Edith Wharton straight up cruel.
If you gonna make your characters suffer,

00:02:28.700 --> 00:02:33.170
it best be for a purpose.
But E-Dub ain’t playin like dat.

00:02:33.170 --> 00:02:37.730
Even through all the pain he gotta
grind through, Ethan don’t learn a damn

00:02:37.730 --> 00:02:40.990
thing. The reader just watches his life get
sh** on.

00:02:40.990 --> 00:02:43.810
And Ethan ain’t the only one who
gets dealt a raw hand.

00:02:43.810 --> 00:02:47.440
After years of bein neglected by
her man and havin to bust her ass on that

00:02:47.440 --> 00:02:53.020
cold-as-a-bitch farm, Zeena slowly turns in
to a boring stiff who ain’t got no soul.

00:02:53.340 --> 00:02:54.620
Ethan don’t just cripple people

00:02:54.630 --> 00:02:59.700
emotionally. After mackin on Mattie hard core,
it ain’t long before she trapped in a bunk

00:02:59.700 --> 00:03:05.100
ass situation too. It’s like this playa
ruins everybody he touches- even himself!

00:03:05.100 --> 00:03:08.900
Now even before he fu**s up his
body, fool’s already broken by the choice

00:03:08.910 --> 00:03:14.130
he’s forced to make. See, Ethan gotta choose
between caring for his miserable old lady,

00:03:14.130 --> 00:03:18.980
or givin in to passion and jumpin ship with
his baby Dip Mattie; Of doing what society

00:03:18.980 --> 00:03:22.270
‘spects of him, or of goin all out for his
own happiness.

00:03:22.270 --> 00:03:26.480
But on the real, this fool’s dreams
were wrecked long before Mattie. Ethan always

00:03:26.480 --> 00:03:30.910
wanted to leave his trap and move up to a
big city where there’s actually sh** to do.

00:03:30.910 --> 00:03:35.810
Since Zeena didn’t wanna leave the hood,
Ethan’s sad ass gotta stay in this icy hell

00:03:35.810 --> 00:03:41.040
just like his ancestors did. Matter of fact,
reality smacks him in the face erry time he

00:03:41.040 --> 00:03:42.920
sees his family plot: 

00:04:05.520 --> 00:04:06.840
But is a life without dreams one

00:04:07.209 --> 00:04:11.150
worth livin? Don’t a brotha owe it to himself
to pursue happiness?

00:04:11.150 --> 00:04:15.989
Maybe not. Some thugz say Wharton
got a lesson for us after all. Maybe chasin

00:04:15.989 --> 00:04:20.949
dreams ain’t the best thing. Maybe the best
we can do is just step to the misery, and

00:04:20.949 --> 00:04:24.290
hold it down.
So march on soldier boy, and cheer

00:04:24.290 --> 00:04:28.340
yourself up with some Thug Notes swag and I'll see you next week. Peace!

